{"name":"Subliminals for appearance","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":18,"casual":{"lead":["Appearance subliminals are audio recordings that supposedly deliver hidden messages to change features such as height, eye colour or jaw growth. They circulate on looksmaxxing forums and on subreddits dedicated to the practice.","No study has tested them for physical change. Subliminal-perception research mostly finds limited effects on behaviour a person already intends, and one self-concept trial found effects resembling placebo apart from a self-concept change."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["Believers say the subconscious mind can be influenced by sub-audible affirmations. Researchers describe subliminal stimuli as stimuli below conscious perception with limited, context-dependent effects."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["Direct physical risk is low. Wikipedia notes subliminal advertising is prohibited in several countries."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"subliminals","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/subliminals.1904937/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260330112349/https://looksmax.org/threads/subliminals.1904937/"},{"title":"subliminals work","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/subliminals-work.1788598/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229142443/https://looksmax.org/threads/subliminals-work.1788598/"},{"title":"Subliminals work??","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/subliminals-work.1359085/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250417074905/https://looksmax.org/threads/subliminals-work.1359085/"},{"title":"subliminals are cope to non believers dopamine friendly","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/subliminals-are-cope-to-non-believers-dopamine-friendly.923634/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240316090355/https://looksmax.org/threads/subli